We are an ethical, human-centered business consulting practice led by a senior Fractional COO with 10+ years of international experience in business development, sales, marketing, and operations.
Our services include 1:1 Mentoring for professionals and freelancers, B2B growth systems (CRM + automated lead generation), conversion-focused websites, all-in-one business platforms, and remote-career training — for companies, individuals, and non-profits.

We are looking for a true SENIOR Google Ads Specialist to become our operational right arm: someone who can build and manage our campaigns practically, from zero, and make them actually work. This is not a one-off task — it's the start of a long-term partnership that will grow as our results grow.

The first mission: lead-generation campaigns on Google Ads for our flagship offer — 1:1 Mentoring (60-min sessions and 10-session paths) — targeting Italian freelancers and professionals who want to sell more, stabilize their income, and/or create their own product or service. Market: Italy, language: Italian or English speakers in Europe. Meta Ads will follow in a later phase, and more channels after that (TikTok, CRM-based e-mail/WhatsApp outreach).

WHO WE ARE LOOKING FOR

A genuinely experienced, intelligent, and pragmatic senior specialist — strictly no juniors, no agencies, no middlemen. Someone who:

- Has built successful lead-gen campaigns from scratch, for real, with real budgets;

- Speaks in numbers (CPL, conversion rate, cost per booked call) — not in generic marketing buzzwords;

- Can work independently with clear goals and minimal supervision;

- Is looking for a stable, recurring, long-term collaboration — not just another quick gig.

- This first month/period will serve as a mutual test: if the campaigns perform and we work well together, you will be prioritized for expanded scope and a growing retainer.

EXPERIENCE & SKILLS REQUIRED

✔ 5+ years of hands-on Google Ads experience (Search and Demand Gen) in lead generation for professional services (coaching, consulting, mentoring, or similar);
✔ Managed total ad budgets of at least $30,000+ across your career;
✔ Full conversion tracking setup: GA4, Google Tag Manager, conversion actions — non-negotiable (our current campaign has no tracking yet: this is your first task);
✔ Landing page conversion best practices (message match, CTA, friction reduction);
✔ Ability to detect and exclude invalid traffic and bot clicks (we have seen a suspicious €0.03 average CPC that needs diagnosis);
✔ Clear, honest weekly reporting with KPIs;
✔ Excellent written English; experience with Italian-language campaigns and the Italian market is a strong plus.

Preferred but not required:
➕ Meta Ads experience (for the second phase);
➕ Experience with outbound/CRM campaigns (e-mail, WhatsApp);
➕ Tik Tok Ads experience (for the future);
➕ Chat GPT Ads experience (for the future);
➕ Interest in ethical business and sustainable growth models.

